# Variadic ...rest collects args after the first param.
# [fn [let _first ...rest] body] called with multiple args:
# _first=first arg, rest={0: second, ...}. Last of rest via dict-length - 1.
[call [fn [let]
  [last: [fn [let _first ...rest]
    [n: [builtin-dict-length rest]]
    [builtin-dict-nth rest [builtin-int-sub n 1]]]]
  [r: [last "ignored" "a" "b" "target"]]
  [builtin-eq-string r "target"]]]
=== out
Int(1)
